{
  "_comment": "Afterimage (echo-puzzle 'Ditto') screenshot capture. 60-level CAMPAIGN (valid loadLevel indices 0-59, display level = idx+1). Themes applied via window._applyAT(id,midnight) which writes Afterimage's real theme palette to PIPE_COLORS + the --you/--echo/--plate/--exit CSS vars + midnight chrome. Each slot picks a distinct level AND a distinct theme so all 11 store slots differ. Non-gameplay screens distributed once each: Themes panel -> phone 06; Level Select grid -> tablet_7 (not in 2-slot trim, kept for completeness); Level Complete overlay -> tablet_7 06; Stats -> tablet_10 06. Phone ships 7, tablets ship 2 each (01_deep + 02_early).",
